Great plan.  One major reason that gray and silver are covetted
and black is not is you get distinegration resistance from eating
the black dragon corpse so the black scales give you nothing
extra just AC points.

If you can get the intrinsic from eating the dragon corpse, do it.
It's the only way to get disintegration resistance.  If you can also
then wear the scales from a different color dragon even better.
Even acid resistance is worth having if the price just happens to
include a bunch of additional AC points.  But among the dragon
colors you can't get the intrinsic from eating, you'll always want
to want improving up to either gray or silver.

If the shimmering is ever added to the game it will make the
